 class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.9": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.10": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.11": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.12": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.13": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.14": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.15": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.16": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.17": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.18": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.19": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.20": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.21": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.22": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.23": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.24": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.25": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.26": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.27": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.28": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.29": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.30": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.31": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.32": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:6.33": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.34": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.35": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:6.36": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "mn116:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "mn116:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "mn116:7.5": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"mn116:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 116 ", "mn116:0.2": "Isigilisutta ", "mn116:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—", "mn116:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati isigilismiṁ pabbate. ", "mn116:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ", "mn116:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ", "mn116:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ", "mn116:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ", "mn116:2.1": "“Passatha no tumhe, bhikkhave, etaṁ vebhāraṁ pabbatan”ti? ", "mn116:2.2": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ", "mn116:2.3": "“Etassapi kho, bhikkhave, vebhārassa pabbatassa aññāva samaññā ahosi aññā paññatti. ", "mn116:2.4": "Passatha no tumhe, bhikkhave, etaṁ paṇḍavaṁ pabbatan”ti? ", "mn116:2.5": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ", "mn116:2.6": "“Etassapi kho, bhikkhave, paṇḍavassa pabbatassa aññāva samaññā ahosi aññā paññatti. ", "mn116:2.7": "Passatha no tumhe, bhikkhave, etaṁ vepullaṁ pabbatan”ti? ", "mn116:2.8": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ", "mn116:2.9": "“Etassapi kho, bhikkhave, vepullassa pabbatassa aññāva samaññā ahosi aññā paññatti. ", "mn116:2.10": "Passatha no tumhe, bhikkhave, etaṁ gijjhakūṭaṁ pabbatan”ti? ", "mn116:2.11": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ", "mn116:2.12": "“Etassapi kho, bhikkhave, gijjhakūṭassa pabbatassa aññāva samaññā ahosi aññā paññatti. ", "mn116:2.13": "Passatha no tumhe, bhikkhave, imaṁ isigiliṁ pabbatan”ti? ", "mn116:2.14": "“Evaṁ, bhante”. ", "mn116:3.1": "“Imassa kho pana, bhikkhave, isigilissa pabbatassa esāva samaññā ahosi esā paññatti. ", "mn116:3.2": "Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, pañca paccekabuddhasatāni imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsino ahesuṁ. ", "mn116:3.3": "Te imaṁ pabbataṁ pavisantā dissanti, paviṭṭhā na dissanti. ", "mn116:3.4": "Tamenaṁ manussā disvā evamāhaṁsu: ", "mn116:3.5": "‘ayaṁ pabbato ime isī gilatī’ti; ", "mn116:3.6": "‘isigili isigili’ tveva samaññā udapādi. ", "mn116:3.7": "Ācikkhissāmi, bhikkhave, paccekabuddhānaṁ nāmāni; ", "mn116:3.8": "kittayissāmi, bhikkhave, paccekabuddhānaṁ nāmāni; ", "mn116:3.9": "desessāmi, bhikkhave, paccekabuddhānaṁ nāmāni. ", "mn116:3.10": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ", "mn116:3.11": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ", "mn116:3.12": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ", "mn116:4.1": "“Ariṭṭho nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.2": "upariṭṭho nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.3": "tagarasikhī nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.4": "yasassī nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.5": "sudassano nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.6": "piyadassī nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.7": "gandhāro nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.8": "piṇḍolo nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.9": "upāsabho nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.10": "nīto nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.11": "tatho nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi, ", "mn116:4.12": "sutavā nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi; ", "mn116:4.13": "bhāvitatto nāma, bhikkhave, paccekasambuddho imasmiṁ isigilismiṁ pabbate ciranivāsī ahosi. ", "mn116:5.1": "Ye sattasārā anīghā nirāsā, ", "mn116:5.2": "Paccekamevajjhagamaṁsu bodhiṁ; ", "mn116:5.3": "Tesaṁ visallāna naruttamānaṁ, ", "mn116:5.4": "Nāmāni me kittayato suṇātha. ", "mn116:5.5": "Ariṭṭho upariṭṭho tagarasikhī yasassī, ", "mn116:5.6": "Sudassano piyadassī ca susambuddho; ", "mn116:5.7": "Gandhāro piṇḍolo upāsabho ca, ", "mn116:5.8": "Nīto tatho sutavā bhāvitatto. ", "mn116:6.1": "Sumbho subho matulo aṭṭhamo ca, ", "mn116:6.2": "Athassumegho anīgho sudāṭho; ", "mn116:6.3": "Paccekabuddhā bhavanettikhīṇā, ", "mn116:6.4": "Hiṅgū ca hiṅgo ca mahānubhāvā. ", "mn116:6.5": "Dve jālino munino aṭṭhako ca, ", "mn116:6.6": "Atha kosallo buddho atho subāhu; ", "mn116:6.7": "Upanemiso nemiso santacitto, ", "mn116:6.8": "Sacco tatho virajo paṇḍito ca. ", "mn116:6.9": "Kāḷūpakāḷā vijito jito ca, ", "mn116:6.10": "Aṅgo ca paṅgo ca guttijito ca; ", "mn116:6.11": "Passi jahi upadhidukkhamūlaṁ, ", "mn116:6.12": "Aparājito mārabalaṁ ajesi. ", "mn116:6.13": "Satthā pavattā sarabhaṅgo lomahaṁso, ", "mn116:6.14": "Uccaṅgamāyo asito anāsavo; ", "mn116:6.15": "Manomayo mānacchido ca bandhumā, ", "mn116:6.16": "Tadādhimutto vimalo ca ketumā. ", "mn116:6.17": "Ketumbharāgo ca mātaṅgo ariyo, ", "mn116:6.18": "Athaccuto accutagāmabyāmako; ", "mn116:6.19": "Sumaṅgalo dabbilo supatiṭṭhito, ", "mn116:6.20": "Asayho khemābhirato ca sorato. ", "mn116:6.21": "Durannayo saṅgho athopi ujjayo, ", "mn116:6.22": "Aparo muni sayho anomanikkamo; ", "mn116:6.23": "Ānando nando upanando dvādasa, ", "mn116:6.24": "Bhāradvājo antimadehadhārī. ", "mn116:6.25": "Bodhi mahānāmo athopi uttaro, ", "mn116:6.26": "Kesī sikhī sundaro dvārabhājo; ", "mn116:6.27": "Tissūpatissā bhavabandhanacchidā, ", "mn116:6.28": "Upasikhi taṇhacchido ca sikhari. ", "mn116:6.29": "Buddho ahu maṅgalo vītarāgo, ", "mn116:6.30": "Usabhacchidā jāliniṁ dukkhamūlaṁ; ", "mn116:6.31": "Santaṁ padaṁ ajjhagamopanīto, ", "mn116:6.32": "Uposatho sundaro saccanāmo. ", "mn116:6.33": "Jeto jayanto padumo uppalo ca, ", "mn116:6.34": "Padumuttaro rakkhito pabbato ca; ", "mn116:6.35": "Mānatthaddho sobhito vītarāgo, ", "mn116:6.36": "Kaṇho ca buddho suvimuttacitto. ", "mn116:7.1": "Ete ca aññe ca mahānubhāvā, ", "mn116:7.2": "Paccekabuddhā bhavanettikhīṇā; ", "mn116:7.3": "Te sabbasaṅgātigate mahesī, ", "mn116:7.4": "Parinibbute vandatha appameyye”ti. ", "mn116:7.5": "Isigilisuttaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"mn116:0.1": "", "mn116:0.2": "", "mn116:1.1": "", "mn116:1.2": "", "mn116:1.3": "", "mn116:1.4": "", "mn116:1.5": "", "mn116:1.6": "", "mn116:2.1": "", "mn116:2.2": "", "mn116:2.3": "", "mn116:2.4": "", "mn116:2.5": "", "mn116:2.6": "", "mn116:2.7"